{
  "purpose": "Content-addressed proof that the V20.2 Earth subsystem (Future Earth SVG geometry, continent paths, glow filters, globeSequenceProgress, bell() sequence windows, opacity/glow-drive constants, gaze formula, v19.1 arrival formulas) is byte-identical between V20.2 and V20.2.1. V20.2.1 changed ONLY the English/LTR swiper settle logic; this manifest is the automated proof that scope promise was kept.",
